<p>If you are running Deepseek on Amazon Bedrock and want to know how much it will cost you then yes this is that awkward money talk. The price you pay depends on a few boring but unavoidable things like model choice tokens per request and how much embedding magic you ask for. This guide will help you estimate prompt cost embedding cost and vector search overhead without requiring a crystal ball.</p>
